<title>USA: Harris County M.U.D., Texas, repriced ylds raised.</title>
<headline>Harris County M.U.D., Texas, repriced ylds raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest Company said Tuesday it repriced Harris County Municipal Utility District No. 180 $9.3 million bond deal, raising yields.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
